  "body": "### Description\r\n\r\nUsers cannot use the \"Reset cross-signing and secret storage\" feature when using SSO auth.\r\n\r\n### Steps to reproduce\r\n\r\n- Log in with SSO\r\n- Go to your security & privacy settings\r\n- Click the \"Reset cross-signing and secret storage\" button\r\n- Go through the process, you'll get an error message\r\n\r\nThe problem comes from /_matrix/client/unstable/keys/device_signing/upload which returns a 401 (because it lacks SSO information).\r\n\r\n### Version information\r\n\r\n- **Homeserver**: matrix.asso-pea.ch\r\n- **Version**: 1.20.1\r\n- **Install method**: pip\r\n- **Platform**: Debian Buster",
